TXT:
1.1-   Show saved Wi-Fi network profiles
     }   netsh wlan show profile

1.2-   Shows details of a specific Wi-Fi profile.
     }   netsh wlan show profile name="  "

1.3-   Shows Wi-Fi details including password.
     }   netsh wlan show profile name=" " key=clear

1.4-   Shows only the saved Wi-Fi password.
    }    netsh wlan show profile name="WiFiName" key=clear | findstr /i "Key Content"
___

2.1-   Show IP address (basic).
    }     ipconfig

2.2-  Show full IP config (DNS, MAC, DHCP).
    }    ipconfig /all
___

3.1-   Set file/folder as hidden system item
     }    attrib +s +h "filename"

3.2-   Remove hidden/system attributes (make visible)
     }    attrib -s -h "filename"
